  (descr "PROVISIONAL mechanical planning: Wakefield 623A, nominal 120.65x76.2x11.7 mm body. Four factory open chassis slots on 111.125x63.5 mm centers; slot radius 0.095in / 2.413mm. PCB 4.5mm NPTH clearance holes and 10mm washer circles are DESIGNER CHOICES, not supplier PCB recommendations. Washer circles are visual only, NOT copper keepouts. A has central TO-3 holes omitted here; keep thermal contact clear after sample review. Solid model is a drawing-derived ENVELOPE, not supplier CAD, and omits fins/slots/TO-3 holes/hardware. 0.5mm nominal TIM offset. Mounting stack, height and complete thermal path require verification. https://wakefieldthermal.com/content/data_sheets/2021_data_sheets/Wakefield-Thermal-Extrusion-Profile-Guide.pdf")
